  "job_B3.2.24_20251003_114627": {
    "chunk_text": "ofan \u00feegne: Ecce mater, \u00deis is \u00fein modor, & \u00feu hie \u00fee for modor hafa. & he \u00fea, Iohannes, swa dyde, & he hie \u00fea in moderlufan h\u00e6fde. W\u00e6s hit midd\u00e6g \u00fea hie hine on rode hengon. & \u00fea he on rode ahangen w\u00e6s, \u00fea ge\u00feystrode hit & efne f\u00e6stlice genihtode ofer eallne middangeard & sio sunne & ealle \u00fea heofontungulu hira leoht betyndon & behyddon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6t mor\u00f0or geseon ne \u00dea wiste he, ure dryhten Crist, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00feing gefylled w\u00e6ron ealle \u00fee be his \u00ferowunge awritene & \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he \u00fea gita: Sitio, & s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hine \u00feyrste. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r sum f\u00e6t mid ecede gefylled. \u00dea genamon hie sume spingan & gefyldon mid ecede & ysopan \u00fea wyrt utan befeoldon, & dydon on Sceolde se witedom bion gefylled \u00fee \u00e6r in \u00feam sealme awriten & awitgod w\u00e6s be \u00feyssum ylcan \u00dea he \u00f0a, Crist, \u00fe\u00e6s ecedes onbyrgde, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Crist: Nu syndon gefylled halige gewrito. \u00dea onhylde he his heafod on o\u00f0ere eaxle & \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6ne gast of \u00feam lichoman onsende. \u00dea noldon hie, \u00fea Iudeas, for heora Eastertidum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea lic ealne d\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re rode w\u00e6ren, for \u00feam hie Eodon \u00fea for\u00fe to Pilate & b\u00e6don hine \u00fe\u00e6t he hete \u00feara manna sceancan brecan on \u00fe\u00e6re rode, \u00fe\u00e6",
